opam-version: "2.0"
synopsis:
  "Generate massive amounts of fake (but realistic) data for testing and development"
description:
  "An OCaml port of @faker-js/faker 10.6.0 with seed-for-seed output parity: for the same seed, every method returns the same value faker-js returns. All 26 modules and all 77 locales are ported."
